{"title":"Trick and Treat","artist":"OSTER Project","sourceId":"reference:BsIbBI9jXcfR9oa1JXsQ","sourceHash":"c07591379cacf003321cba32b2f854599296b1b9cc3cb830999ac2ce06fc5fc1","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.52,"end":18.52,"text":"深い深い 霧の中 妖艶に響く声","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.02,"end":26.02,"text":"おいでおいで この森のもっと奥深くまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":30.14,"end":33.14,"text":"早く早く 急ぎ足で出来るだけ近くに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":37.28,"end":40.28,"text":"おいでおいで さぁ愉しい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":40.34,"end":43.34,"text":"遊戯を始めよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":44.18,"end":47.18,"text":"シナモンスティックは魔法のステッキ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":47.84,"end":50.84,"text":"ひとふりするだけでシロップが増える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":50.94,"end":53.94,"text":"苦ささえ忘れて 甘い夢の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":54.59,"end":57.59,"text":"天蓋に護られて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":58.09,"end":59.15,"text":"眠りに堕ちる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":59.15,"end":61.94,"text":"幻想の催眠に溺れたままで良い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":61.94,"end":64.94,"text":"目隠しを外しちゃ面白くないでしょ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":65.32,"end":68.32,"text":"足元ご注意 その手は僕が引くから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":68.73,"end":71.16,"text":"その身を今すぐに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":71.16,"end":74.16,"text":"委ねなさい さぁ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":113.55,"end":116.55,"text":"いつからか疑念の刃が見え隠れする","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":119.15,"end":122.15,"text":"愛という免罪符などは存在しないと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":127.1,"end":130.1,"text":"目隠しの隙間から覗き見たランタンが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":135.06,"end":138.06,"text":"映し出した影に思わず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":139.6,"end":142.09,"text":"身の毛がよだった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":142.09,"end":145.09,"text":"おやおや悪い子 もうお目覚めですか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":145.47,"end":147.28,"text":"目隠しが解けたなら 盲目にしようか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":147.28,"end":150.28,"text":"ほらほら笑いなさい 可愛いお顔で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":152.47,"end":154.82,"text":"毛皮をまた被って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":154.82,"end":157.32999999999998,"text":"芝居に戻る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":157.32999999999998,"end":160.32999999999998,"text":"「...ねぇ、ちょうだい？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":162.98,"end":165.98,"text":"どうしたのそんな目で 身体を震わせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":166.56,"end":169.56,"text":"温かいミルクでもてなして欲しいの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":170.04,"end":173.04,"text":"さぁ中にお入り ここはとても温かい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":174.16,"end":177.16,"text":"見返りはポケットの中身でいいから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":177.51,"end":179.66,"text":"ちょうだい 早く早く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":179.66,"end":181.18,"text":"ねぇほら 今すぐに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":181.18,"end":184.18,"text":"二者択一の原則をかなぐり捨て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":184.56,"end":187.55,"text":"まやかしでもてなして 甘い蜜を吸って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":187.55,"end":190.55,"text":"ちょうだい よこせ ほら 今すぐに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":190.83,"end":193.83,"text":"ちょうだい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}